  "description": "Lightweight .NET MAUI controls drawn entirely with SkiaSharp on a single canvas: no native child views, so showing, tapping and paging cost one redraw. Includes SkiaCalendarView (single/range date selection, month and year pickers, swipe paging, simple colorization) and SkiaToggleButton (one-of-many or several-of-many selection set by one binding on the container or a check function) SkiaComboBox (drop-down list in a native popup with elevation) SkiaSelectorView (multiple-choice list with a header, Select all and Clear) and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images with indicators that also works inside SkiaCollectionView item templates).",
  "id": "SkiaMauiControls",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-16T02:48:12.173Z",
